| TC_CART_002 | Verify added product appears in the cart | User has added one product | 1. Click the shopping cart icon. | Sauce Labs Backpack | The selected product is displayed in the cart. |
| TC_CART_003 | Verify multiple products appear in the cart | User has added multiple products | 1. Add three products.<br>2. Click the shopping cart icon. | N/A | All selected products are displayed in the cart. |
| TC_CART_004 | Verify product name is displayed in the cart | User has added a product | 1. Open the shopping cart. | N/A | Product name is displayed correctly. |
| TC_CART_005 | Verify product price is displayed in the cart | User has added a product | 1. Open the shopping cart. | N/A | Product price is displayed correctly. |
| TC_CART_006 | Verify product quantity is displayed | User has added a product | 1. Open the shopping cart. | N/A | Product quantity is displayed correctly. |
